      "id": "provider-source",
      "statement": "ADDITIONAL_API_KEY_PATTERN in the published SDK core, the webapp customAlphabet([0-9a-zA-Z], 24) generator and the legacy 20-byte root generator at trigger.dev@4.0.0 (re-checked 2026-09-28): provider code (ruling R1): tr_ + one of dev|stg|prod|preview + _sk_ + exactly 24 [0-9A-Za-z] for an additional key, tr_<env>_ + 24 for a current root key and tr_<env>_ + 20 for a legacy root key; the docs corroborate the prefixes",
      "evidenceClass": "provider-documented",
      "temporality": "current",
      "observedAt": "2026-09-28",
      "sources": [
        {
          "sourceId": "github-com-triggerdotdev-trigger-dev-6b48ba1909",
